{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "回到那张卡",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 84.26,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "普通用户，可以从这几件事做起。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，可以从这几件事做起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.527
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "交易所和邮箱，用硬件密钥或验证器 App，关掉短信验证。",
   "spoken": "交易所和邮箱，用硬件密钥或验证器 App，关掉短信验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.94,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 4.94,
   "speechEnd": 10.133
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "向运营商申请号码转移锁。",
   "spoken": "向运营商申请号码转移锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 10.52,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 10.52,
   "speechEnd": 13.087
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "关注的项目方账号，突然发限时空投、紧急迁移，先去别的官方渠道核实。",
   "spoken": "关注的项目方账号，突然发限时空投、紧急迁移，先去别的官方渠道核实。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 13.54,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 13.54,
   "speechEnd": 18.91
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "和陌生网友线下见面，选公共场所，让别人知道你的行程。",
   "spoken": "和陌生网友线下见面，选公共场所，让别人知道你的行程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 19.36,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 19.36,
   "speechEnd": 24.183
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "遭遇胁迫时，人身安全第一，事后立即报警。",
   "spoken": "遭遇胁迫时，人身安全第一，事后立即报警。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 24.62,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 24.62,
   "speechEnd": 28.652
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "如果你是多签签名人，今天就查一遍，你的手机号能不能单独重置哪个账号。",
   "spoken": "如果你是多签签名人，今天就查一遍，你的手机号能不能单独虫置哪个账号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 29.08,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 29.176,
   "speechEnd": 35.314
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "如果你管理官方账号，今天就把它的多因素认证，换成硬件密钥。",
   "spoken": "如果你管理官方账号，今天就把它的多因素认证，换成硬件密钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 35.78,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 35.874,
   "speechEnd": 40.578
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "如果你负责团队，列一份关键人员名单，给每个人配上号码锁和硬件密钥。",
   "spoken": "如果你负责团队，列一份关键人员名单，给每个人配上号码锁和硬件密钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 41.04,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 41.135,
   "speechEnd": 47.231
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "回到开头的题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 47.66,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 47.66,
   "speechEnd": 48.762
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "答案是没有，SEC 承认，此前曾请 X 关闭这个账号的多因素认证。",
   "spoken": "答案是没有，SEC 承认，此前曾请 X 关闭这个账号的多因素认证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 49.16,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 49.16,
   "speechEnd": 55.501
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "攻击者对绑定的手机号做了 SIM 卡劫持，再用重置码登录。",
   "spoken": "攻击者对绑定的手机号做了 SIM 卡劫持，再用虫置码登录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 55.94,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 55.94,
   "speechEnd": 61.055
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "负责换卡的人，2025 年被判 14 个月。",
   "spoken": "负责换卡的人，2025 年被判 14 个月。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 61.52,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 61.52,
   "speechEnd": 65.274
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "监管机构的账号也会失守，只要一条短信，就能单独完成恢复。",
   "spoken": "监管机构的账号也会失守，只要一条短信，就能单独完成恢复。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-13.wav",
   "start": 65.74,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 65.74,
   "speechEnd": 70.929
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "攻击从链上走到线下，防线就要让一张卡、一次胁迫，都不够拿走一切。",
   "spoken": "攻击从链上走到线下，防线就要让一张卡、一次胁迫，都不够拿走一切。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-14.wav",
   "start": 71.32,
   "dur": 7.52,
   "speechStart": 71.419,
   "speechEnd": 78.643
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-15",
   "text": "下一集讲托管、充提与合规安全。",
   "spoken": "下一集讲托管、充提与合规安全。",
